    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MORE GAMES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Daomei Village</strong></h2><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/ed8501fdea3cb55c9fc99e09a09324d2.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Daomei Village is a charming, pixel art game set in a quaint environment that stimulates creativity!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/dcb1a8d5bc6a68763ce56c1d46129972.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>By order of the Emperor, you have been transferred to Daomei Village and tasked with restoring it to its splendor. Remember that nothing will escape the attention of the tax collector, who will demand the tributes claimable by the Emperor. Therefore, you have to take care of the farm, cultivate the fields, and breed the animals to generate income. It won't be easy at first, as you will only have a few simple tools, 100 yuan, some rice seeds, and some tea. However, don't give up! An amazing adventure awaits you. You will meet friends who, like you, were sent to the Unlucky Village for their crimes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/567cc00bf2634dca0a223293b6532178.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Changes in the seasons affect the possibility of growing vegetables and flowers. Each species of animal requires a dedicated space. Go ahead, create the place of your dreams - fields, buildings, surroundings. You can create and improve it all. Introduce crop automation technology and beautify the area.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/59e47199bd7dd542acc69281d8346e8b.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Activities for the Village will bring you happiness and recognition. The reassured Emperor will allow you to go to the lands of the enemies occupied by the imperial army. Thanks to this, you will obtain information about new technologies, as well as get new raw materials, tools and seeds. The more difficult the terrain, the greater the chance of unique achievements.However, the risk of a fight also increases. Everything you get during the expeditions is yours and can be used to build your Village. You decide on the pace of its development. You are its leader.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/5291a9b702f943933996dde50c16e9ff.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>In Daomei Village, everyone has committed a crime of some sort. When interacting with the townspeople, you will receive tasks that will help you gain their trust. Moreover, you will learn the reason behind their crime.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/ce76627d5726c131c464614ee71d3f96.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Daomei Village is an absolutely unique and magical place. You will come across the traces of previous dynasties, learn about the unique Chinese folklore and demonology. You will celebrate feasts accordingQ to the Chinese calendar, as well as the birthdays of the residents. You cannot miss it!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Daomei Village</strong></h2><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/ed8501fdea3cb55c9fc99e09a09324d2.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Daomei Village is a charming, pixel art game set in a quaint environment that stimulates creativity!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/dcb1a8d5bc6a68763ce56c1d46129972.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>By order of the Emperor, you have been transferred to Daomei Village and tasked with restoring it to its splendor. Remember that nothing will escape the attention of the tax collector, who will demand the tributes claimable by the Emperor. Therefore, you have to take care of the farm, cultivate the fields, and breed the animals to generate income. It won't be easy at first, as you will only have a few simple tools, 100 yuan, some rice seeds, and some tea. However, don't give up! An amazing adventure awaits you. You will meet friends who, like you, were sent to the Unlucky Village for their crimes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/db7eac270fb5ae83bbdfe67384116358.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/567cc00bf2634dca0a223293b6532178.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Changes in the seasons affect the possibility of growing vegetables and flowers. Each species of animal requires a dedicated space. Go ahead, create the place of your dreams - fields, buildings, surroundings. You can create and improve it all. Introduce crop automation technology and beautify the area.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/f5d052ede87bbe18bef1b5ec3875f960.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/59e47199bd7dd542acc69281d8346e8b.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Activities for the Village will bring you happiness and recognition. The reassured Emperor will allow you to go to the lands of the enemies occupied by the imperial army. Thanks to this, you will obtain information about new technologies, as well as get new raw materials, tools and seeds. The more difficult the terrain, the greater the chance of unique achievements.However, the risk of a fight also increases. Everything you get during the expeditions is yours and can be used to build your Village. You decide on the pace of its development. You are its leader.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.poster.avif?t=1747631255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.webm?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.mp4?t=1747631255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/5291a9b702f943933996dde50c16e9ff.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>In Daomei Village, everyone has committed a crime of some sort. When interacting with the townspeople, you will receive tasks that will help you gain their trust. Moreover, you will learn the reason behind their crime.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/ce76627d5726c131c464614ee71d3f96.avif?t=1747631255\" /></div><br>Daomei Village is an absolutely unique and magical place. You will come across the traces of previous dynasties, learn about the unique Chinese folklore and demonology. You will celebrate feasts accordingQ to the Chinese calendar, as well as the birthdays of the residents. You cannot miss it!",
    "short_description": "You have been banished to Daomei Village for your offense. In order to return to the Emperor's favor, you must make an effort. Repair, build, cultivate fields and fight various adversities. Meet new friends and learn their stories. Do whatever it takes not to be banished forever!",
